CHAPTER.VERS:
For if Hashem did not spare malachim that sinned, but cast them into Gehinnom, consigning them to the kaval 

          chain/fetter
         of choshech to be kept for Mishpat;

[for that tzaddik, living among them day after day, was tortured in his nefesh hayesharah
honest soul by the darchei mufkarim
the ways of lawless ones that he saw and heard];
